voxagent reimplements Puppet's catalog apply behaviour in Go. Its behaviour,
messages and report format are derived from Puppet 8.10.0's source, which the
code cites by path and line. No Puppet source file is redistributed
unmodified.

voxagent's native concat (internal/ral/concat*.go) likewise reproduces the
behaviour and messages of puppetlabs-concat 9.1.0 and 10.0.1 ("Puppet Module -
puppetlabs-concat, Copyright 2018 Puppet, Inc."), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. The four type files of puppetlabs-concat 9.1.0 and 10.0.1
(concat_file.rb and concat_fragment.rb of each) are redistributed unmodified as
test fixtures under internal/ral/testdata/concat; they remain under the Apache
License, Version 2.0, a copy of which is in LICENSE.md.

voxagent's native sysctl, ssh_config, sshd_config and sshd_config_subsystem
(internal/ral/augeas*.go, sysctl*.go, ssh*_config.go, sshd_subsystem.go)
likewise reproduce the behaviour and messages of Vox Pupuli's
augeasproviders_core 4.2.0, augeasproviders_sysctl 4.1.0 and
augeasproviders_ssh 7.0.0 ("Copyright (c) 2012 Dominic Cleal", "Copyright (c)
2012-2020 Raphaël Pinson"), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The twelve files of those releases whose digests voxagent checks are
redistributed unmodified as test fixtures under
internal/ral/testdata/augeasproviders; they remain under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, a copy of which is in LICENSE.md. At run time voxagent loads
openvox's libaugeas (LGPL-2.1-or-later) with dlopen; it redistributes neither
libaugeas nor ruby-augeas.

voxagent's native augeas type (internal/ral/augeas_generic*.go) reproduces the
behaviour and messages of Puppet, Inc.'s puppetlabs-augeas_core 2.1.0
("Copyright 2011 Bryan Kearney", Apache-2.0). Its four files whose digests
voxagent checks (puppet/type/augeas.rb, puppet/provider/augeas/augeas.rb,
puppet_x/augeas/util/parser.rb and puppet/feature/augeas.rb) are redistributed
unmodified as test fixtures under internal/ral/testdata/augeas_core; they remain
under the Apache License, Version 2.0, a copy of which is in LICENSE.md.

